ains its negative terminal-distance term.\r\n\r\nStacked on OPEN draft PR #151, exact base `c4eb0fcea94e242bc93264e6d9ba3ef7d2c4acce`, branch `codex/research-online-optimal-step`. That dependency is not merged into main. Scope is the unnumbered unit argument/example on printed 21–22 / PDF 33–34 of [Orabona v10](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1912.13213v10), with explicit library refinements: whole space, positive invertible coordinate scalar, the same transported exogenous policy and unchanged loss units. The numerical example demonstrates a real path difference, not a universal worse-regret claim. Finite performance retains proper support and actual played-legality assumptions.\r\n\r\nValidation:\r\n\r\n- 22 actual public proofs, four definitions/alias and 30 meaningful canaries; c=1000 gives corrected eta=10^-6 and actual physical outputs -1 versus -10^6. Positive/T0/c0/c1 boundaries are covered.\r\n- Root and Tests passed; full `python tools/bandit.py check` passed with 466 Python tests and seven existing skips. The 62 named axiom records use only standard Lean axioms.\r\n- 26 shared registry nodes/native fingerprints, 21 required actual proof-value pairs and eight-path contributor coverage passed. Prior 10764 registry IDs/URLs remain intact.\r\n- Official clean local site02 build/check and first-viewport browser inspection passed. Distinct required automated semantic actors accepted with explicit deltas; the final binding gate rechecked 1303 raw rows. No human/external review claim.\r\n\r\nEvidence and retained failures: `runs/online-unit-scaling-20261004/package-validation.md`, `accepted-decision.json`, `accepted-binding-audit.json`, `final-reader-review.md`, actual gate logs and compiled graph scope. Full diff whitespace check fails only on preserved raw task compiler logs; the scoped check covers every other path. No generated site, anonymous snapshot or manuscript changes.\r\n\r\nChapter 2 enumeration and the older 26-path independent semantic/contribution migration 